k (will not walk off of ledges as long as held down)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spacebar:</strong> Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter/Esc/Backspace:</strong> Options Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E:</strong> Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T:</strong> First Person Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Xbox Controller Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>B Button:</strong> Run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>X Button:</strong> Safety Walk (will not walk off of ledges as long as held down)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Button:</strong> Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start/Options Button:</strong> Options Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Trigger:</strong> Interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L3:</strong> Camera Reset</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>R3:</strong> First Person Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start Button:</strong> Options Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>L3:</strong> Re-center camera</p>","developers":["Glimmerware"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085180/header.jpg?t=1756391307","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3085180/720750/6e58b979ceb00853c098ff2108b0147c3bd3da4c/1750973532/dash_av1.mpd?t=1722963773","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3085180/720750/6e58b979ceb00853c098ff2108b0147c3bd3da4c/1750973532/dash_h264.mpd?t=1722963773","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3085180/720750/6e58b979ceb00853c098ff2108b0147c3bd3da4c/1750973532/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1722963773","id":257034999,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257034999/movie480.mp4?t=1722963773","max":"https://video.akamai.steams